          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azeli wadiŋi nawanyi malinawu diwu awa; Azirikani, Bokeru, niIshimeli, niSheyariya, niObadiya, niHanani. Wenawa diwu adiŋi anyana kaAzeli amayala.",
          "type": "text",
